udes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-30-20i3t","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-29-h50ug","text":"Embedded content from other websites"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-33-eg8bj","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-31-v0v9a","text":"Suggested text: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"key-32-yrdgp","text":"Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-35-40cs3","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-34-0xx9b","text":"These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-37-r2myh","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-36-frd6t","text":"Who we share your data with"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-40-ivd8r","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-38-wtmu3","text":"Suggested text: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"key-39-1urck","text":"If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-42-es8k4","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-41-ljxsv","text":"How long we retain your data"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-45-i5zky","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-43-8x1mh","text":"Suggested text: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"key-44-nsx2f","text":"If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-47-0r99o","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-46-jkilw","text":"For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-49-ly15q","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-48-x0d3y","text":"What rights you have over your data"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-52-4blmw","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-50-0q9o4","text":"Suggested text: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"key-51-saq03","text":"If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes."}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-54-0u1xu","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-53-dymqp","text":"Where your data is sent"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"key-57-4nqnp","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"key-55-nztmr","text":"Suggested text: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"key-56-8gxag","text":"Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service."}]}]', NULL, NULL);
